+`FP_TUDOR_PAIRING_DIR` moves the pairing directory. On this branch it is
+read always, the owner's hardware test scripts depend on that. On
+`synaptics-tudor-upstream` only in emulation mode (option (b) above).
+
+`FP_TUDOR_NEVER_REPAIR` (dev branch only, not upstream) makes an open fail where it would pair the
 sensor again, also when the sensor refuses the stored pairing, so a test
 run can never orphan the enrolled templates.
 
